      "timestamp": "2026-09-25T11:57:19.171486Z",
      "user_text": "Here we assume underdamped (oscillatory) motion, $D>0$. This choice is a physical judgment that depends on the problem being treated, and is not something the tool should decide on its own, so it is assumed explicitly, as follows.",
